OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FSpells of rain in the south and
OL,6,Fwest will persist throughout the day.
OL,7,FCloudy further north, becoming
OL,8,Fbrighter throughout the day but with
OL,9,Flimited sunshine. Breezy, especially
OL,10,Fover hills, which will add to the cold
OL,11,Ffeel of the day.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FThe breeze will ease, and so
OL,14,Fwill the rain in the southwest though
OL,15,Flight patches will last till dawn. A
OL,16,Fcold night, particularly in the
OL,17,Fnortheast with some frost there.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
